          <Criterion ?01M05F1PNJ5BBBFTYW68678KWP>
          现有 inspect/validate 行为保持并通过测试
          </?01M05F1PNJ5BBBFTYW68678KWP>
        ]>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task { id = "T1.1" name = "新增 WorkflowComponent、WorkflowQueryService 和 WorkflowCommandService" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PNKSVW9ZQDBYJM6DV1E>
            新增 component/service 目录，提供 inspect capability、validate ref、create bundle draft、patch bundle draft 的共享入口。
            </?01M05F1PNKSVW9ZQDBYJM6DV1E>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "T1.1-AC1" checked = true } ?01M05F1PNKSVW9ZQDBYJM6DV1F>
              component/service 导出可被 workflow tools 和未来 CLI 复用
              </?01M05F1PNKSVW9ZQDBYJM6DV1F>
