              unsafe resource refs 仍由 contract validation 拒绝
              </?01M05F1PNKSVW9ZQDBYJM6DV1G>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T1.2" name = "建立现有 inspect/validate tools 到共享 service" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PNKSVW9ZQDBYJM6DV1H>
            修改 WorkflowInspectCapability 与 WorkflowValidateResourceRef 的 core logic，使其调用 workflow component/service。
            </?01M05F1PNKSVW9ZQDBYJM6DV1H>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "T1.2-AC1" checked = true } ?01M05F1PNKSVW9ZQDBYJM6DV1J>
              WorkflowInspectCapability 输出仍包含 forms、schemes、owned facts 与 roots injection 状态
              </?01M05F1PNKSVW9ZQDBYJM6DV1J>
              <Criterion { id = "T1.2-AC2" checked = true } ?01M05F1PNKSVW9ZQDBYJM6DV1K>
              WorkflowValidateResourceRef 输出仍兼容既有 validation result JSON
              </?01M05F1PNKSVW9ZQDBYJM6DV1K>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P2 { name = "Authoring native tools" status = "DONE" order = 1 } (
        <Description ?01M05F1PNKSVW9ZQDBYJM6DV1M>
        新增 WorkflowCreateBundle 与 WorkflowPatchBundle 对话内 native tools。
        </?01M05F1PNKSVW9ZQDBYJM6DV1M>
        <Gate [
          <Criterion ?01M05F1PNKSVW9ZQDBYJM6DV1N>
